// PLAN-011 G03/3d author source (base variant): the original PLAN-877
// hierarchy entry rebuilt through the view-3d author chain (auto-ui PLAN-027
// delivery, components-3d-runtime profile). Fidelity map against the
// historical scene.agscene (kept byte-preserved as history):
//   group id 20 "root 3d"  -> group3d root_3d  position (0.5, 0.0, 0.0)
//   group id 21 "child 3d" -> group3d child_3d position (0.5, 1.0, 0.0)
//                             parent = root_3d (was parent 20)
//   object id 1 "leaf player" (Kind::Player) -> player3d leaf_player
//                             local (0,0,0) under root_3d (was parent 20)
//   object id 2 "deep mob"    (Kind::Mob)    -> mob3d deep_mob
//                             local (0.8,0,0) under child_3d (was parent 21)
// so deep_mob world stays (1.8, 1.0, 0.0). player3d/mob3d are named built-in
// visual leaves that map the original Kind::Player/Mob meshes and materials
// (player.glb 05d8588e…/52392B, mob.glb 8a82adb5…/63828B via the driver warm
// upload); they never bind a character/camera/scale here. Pure static scene:
// no model/msg/on anywhere, behavior=null, no user VM.
node Main {
    view-3d {
        group3d root_3d {
            position: (0.5, 0.0, 0.0)
            player3d leaf_player {
                position: (0.0, 0.0, 0.0)
            }
            group3d child_3d {
                position: (0.5, 1.0, 0.0)
                mob3d deep_mob {
                    position: (0.8, 0.0, 0.0)
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
